  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "stamford",
      "text": "Watson? Good Lord, man. What have you done to yourself?",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Young Stamford, from Barts. Nobody had said my name in weeks.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 5.708,
      "seconds": 4.77
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "I wanted cheap rooms. He gave me an odd look and named a fellow at the chemical laboratory.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 12.5,
      "seconds": 6.22
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He had found rooms too dear for one purse and wanted someone to go halves.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 20.75,
      "seconds": 5.06
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Afghanistan had sent me home with a ruined shoulder and eleven shillings a day.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 27.125,
      "seconds": 5.13
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A man in that state does not ask who his companion is. Only the price.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 33.958,
      "seconds": 5.18
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "I said I was the very man. Stamford did not look at me.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 40.875,
      "seconds": 4.28
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Holmes was a little too scientific, Stamford said. It approached to cold-bloodedness.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 49.167,
      "seconds": 6.74
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He had seen him beating the subjects in the dissecting rooms with a stick.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 57.417,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "To verify, Stamford said, how far a bruise may be produced after death.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 64.208,
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "I should have turned back. I followed him through the door.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 70.708,
      "seconds": 3.63
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Cold-blooded, Stamford had said. The man sprang up shouting like a child with a new toy.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 76.375,
      "seconds": 6.14
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Stamford made the introduction as if handing over a parcel.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 84.25,
      "seconds": 4.06
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The man looked at my coat, my hands, my leg.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 90.333,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "How are you? You have been in Afghanistan, I perceive.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 96.292,
      "seconds": 3.28
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "I had not said one word about Afghanistan.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 100.583,
      "seconds": 3.94
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He did not explain. Never mind, he said, chuckling; the question now was haemoglobin.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 106.542,
      "seconds": 7.16
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "An infallible test for blood stains, he said, as if that settled anything.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 114.402,
      "seconds": 5.08
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "We may consider the thing settled, if the rooms suit you.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 121.208,
      "seconds": 3.41
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A suite in Baker Street, at noon. Before we reached the street he had forgotten us.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 125.75,
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "How the deuce did he know I was in Afghanistan?",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 132.75,
      "seconds": 3.58
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Just his little peculiarity, Stamford said. A good many people had wanted to know.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 137.458,
      "seconds": 5.41
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "stamford",
      "text": "He'll learn more about you than you about him.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 144.583,
      "seconds": 2.67
    }
  ]
}